title: "Water-quality UMAP reproducibility package"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for Machine-learning-derived chemical signatures for network-scale river monitoring: 
  A case study of England's routine water-quality archive: preprocessing, the 12-feature /
  8,857-site analytical matrix, the retained UMAP embedding, direct and hybrid
  peer retrieval, systematic benchmarking, robustness analyses, and the UMAP
  hyperparameter sweep.
